@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy &amp; Cookies | Fellside Digital</PageTitle>

<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Privacy &amp; Cookies</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-10">Last updated: @DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Who we are</h2>
            <p>
                This site is operated by Fellside Digital Ltd (Keswick, Cumbria). If you have any
                questions about this notice or your data, contact us at
                <a href="mailto:hello@fellsidedigital.co.uk" class="text-accent underline">hello@fellsidedigital.co.uk</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Analytics cookies</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">
                With your consent, we collect anonymous information about how visitors use our site so
                we can understand our audience and improve. We do <strong>not</strong> use this to
                identify you personally, and we do not track you across other websites.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-2">What we collect when you accept:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
                <li>Device type, operating system and browser (from your browser's user-agent)</li>
                <li>Screen and window size, language and timezone</li>
                <li>Approximate country (from your network provider, where available)</li>
                <li>The page you viewed, how you arrived (referring site / campaign tags), and rough engagement (time on page, scroll depth)</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">
                Your IP address is <strong>never stored</strong> — it is converted to a one-way,
                salted hash used only to count unique visitors. A random session identifier is stored
                in a first-party cookie; it is not linked to your name, email or account.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Your choice</h2>
            <p>
                Analytics only run if you select <strong>Accept</strong> on our cookie banner. If you
                choose <strong>Reject</strong>, no analytics cookies are set and nothing is recorded.
                You can withdraw consent at any time by clearing this site's cookies in your browser.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Legal basis &amp; retention</h2>
            <p>
                We rely on your consent (UK GDPR Art. 6(1)(a) and PECR reg. 6) for analytics cookies.
                Aggregate analytics data is retained only as long as needed for reporting and then
                deleted or further anonymised.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
